# Mastery and nothing else, unlike the warriors' Weapon Mastery, which also
# buys speed and crit. What the Hunter gets in its place is Quiver Cartridge.
name: "Bow Mastery"
description:
  "Trains your draw until your arrows land where you mean them to, "
  "narrowing your weakest shots toward your best. Needs a bow in hand."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HUNTER
max_level: 20
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_BOW
base { mastery: 0.12 }
per_level { mastery: 0.02 }
